			<tr><td><a href="img/osanshouo013.jpg">
				<img height="283" src="img/osanshouo013_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///C:/My Web Sites/mysite2/BANDAI/osanshouo_repti/img/osanshouo013.jpg" --></a><a href="img/osanshouo014.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/osanshouo014_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///C:/My Web Sites/mysite2/BANDAI/osanshouo_repti/img/osanshouo014.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
			<tr><td class="comment">&nbsp;</td></tr>
			<tr><td><a href="img/osanshouo015.jpg">
				<img height="283" src="img/osanshouo015_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///C:/My Web Sites/mysite2/BANDAI/osanshouo_repti/img/osanshouo015.jpg" --></a><a href="img/osanshouo016.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/osanshouo016_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///C:/My Web Sites/mysite2/BANDAI/osanshouo_repti/img/osanshouo016.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
			<tr><td class="comment">ライトカラーと斑紋の位置が異なっています。<br />
				塗装マスクは別のものを使っているのですね。</td></tr>
